    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Budget Backrooms</strong>, a free-to-play game set in the classic Backrooms creepy pasta, this time keeping it low-budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a mysterious place, somehow you noclipped into the Backrooms, you get up, pick up your flashlight and start exploring the corners of the so-called 'Level 0' best known as &quot;The Lobby&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels in this game have a unique and linear layout, you will find plenty of content to explore, easter-eggs and 'Sub-Levels'. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Budget Backrooms</strong> tries its best to deliver a constant and immersive Backrooms experience throughout the gameplay, from sound effects to modest graphics quality. The game uses binaural audio so playing with headphones is strongly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 3 Entities in this game, but the ones that stand out are <strong>The Howler</strong> which will chase you if you get too close, and <strong>The Smiler</strong> killing you if you shine light in his area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community Driven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to contribute to the game you can do so by joining the active Discord Server or by contributing to the source code on GitHub.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Budget Backrooms</strong>, a free-to-play game set in the classic Backrooms creepy pasta, this time keeping it low-budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself in a mysterious place, somehow you noclipped into the Backrooms, you get up, pick up your flashlight and start exploring the corners of the so-called 'Level 0' best known as &quot;The Lobby&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels in this game have a unique and linear layout, you will find plenty of content to explore, easter-eggs and 'Sub-Levels'. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Atmosphere</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Budget Backrooms</strong> tries its best to deliver a constant and immersive Backrooms experience throughout the gameplay, from sound effects to modest graphics quality. The game uses binaural audio so playing with headphones is strongly recommended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 3 Entities in this game, but the ones that stand out are <strong>The Howler</strong> which will chase you if you get too close, and <strong>The Smiler</strong> killing you if you shine light in his area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community Driven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to contribute to the game you can do so by joining the active Discord Server or by contributing to the source code on GitHub.</p>",
